emic  researchers or so called fringe  researchers or even those that think  that aliens built the pyramids the one  thing that we all have in common is the  fact that we have all been left in the  dark about this discovery assignment  every one that shares the unique passion  for our ancient history to unite and  come together and realize that hey we're  not being fed the whole story and if  there's one thing that we all have in  common is that we want to know what the  truth is right and without a doubt all  of us want to know what the story is of  these buried columns why were they  buried in the first place and what is  waiting to be seen down below anyways  guys I'm gonna wrap it up here but leave  a comments let me know what your  thoughts are on all of this hit the like  button and subscribe if you haven't and  of course follow me on Instagram if you  haven't done that already but I'll leave  it there look forward to a great video  coming soon but yeah I'm Jimmy this is  bright insight take care everybody
 

